{"seq":1,"slug":"carbon-label-product-display","title":"商品碳标签与买家展示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-logistics-carbon-footprint/carbon-label-disclosure/carbon-label-product-display","wordCount":1700,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"商品碳标签与买家展示\">商品碳标签与买家展示</h1><p>把碳足迹放到商品详情页上，看起来是整条链路里最简单的一步——不就是多显示一个数字吗。实际上这一步的风险最集中：数字一旦面向消费者，它就从&quot;内部数据&quot;变成了<strong>环境声明</strong>，而环境声明在很多法域受专门规则约束，写错要担责。2024 年以来欧盟对漂绿声明的收紧，已经把&quot;碳中和&quot;这类措辞从营销自由变成了合规红线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>商品碳标签在技术上有三个必须绑定的属性：<strong>覆盖的边界</strong>（摇篮到大门还是摇篮到坟墓）、<strong>声明单位</strong>（一件、一公斤、一套）、<strong>核验状态</strong>（自声明、第三方核验、认证）。这三个属性缺任何一个，标签就不可比、不可信。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[PCF 核算结果] --&gt; B{边界}&#10;  B --&gt;|摇篮到大门| C[B2B 场景]&#10;  B --&gt;|摇篮到坟墓| D[B2C 场景]&#10;  C --&gt; E[标签生成]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F{声明类型}&#10;  F --&gt;|披露型| G[显示 kgCO2e 数值]&#10;  F --&gt;|减量型| H[显示相对基准的下降]&#10;  F --&gt;|比较型| I[显示与同类产品的比较]&#10;  G --&gt; J[核验]&#10;  H --&gt; J&#10;  I --&gt; J&#10;  J --&gt; K[详情页展示]\">graph TD\n  A[PCF 核算结果] --&gt; B{边界}\n  B --&gt;|摇篮到大门| C[B2B 场景]\n  B --&gt;|摇篮到坟墓| D[B2C 场景]\n  C --&gt; E[标签生成]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F{声明类型}\n  F --&gt;|披露型| G[显示 kgCO2e 数值]\n  F --&gt;|减量型| H[显示相对基准的下降]\n  F --&gt;|比较型| I[显示与同类产品的比较]\n  G --&gt; J[核验]\n  H --&gt; J\n  I --&gt; J\n  J --&gt; K[详情页展示]</pre><p><strong>披露型</strong>声明只显示数字，合规风险最低。<strong>减量型</strong>声明声称&quot;比去年降低 X%&quot;，要求你能出示基准年数据与可比的核算方法。<strong>比较型</strong>声明最危险：声称&quot;比同类产品更低碳&quot;，在 GHG Protocol 产品标准的框架下被明确排除，因为该标准本身就声明不用于产品间的直接对比——只有当存在同一产品类别规则（PCR 或 PEFCR）并且两个产品都按它核算时，比较才成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平台展示的信息架构\">平台展示的信息架构</h2><h3 id=\"三段式-结论-边界-来源\">三段式：结论、边界、来源</h3><p>详情页上的碳信息不是孤立的一行字，它需要一套能回答用户追问的结构。推荐的展示分层是：主标签给结论，展开层给边界，详情层给方法与数据来源。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;carbon_label&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;display_value&quot;: &quot;1.8&quot;,&#10;    &quot;unit&quot;: &quot;kg CO2e&quot;,&#10;    &quot;declared_unit&quot;: &quot;1 件（含包装，净重 0.42 kg）&quot;,&#10;    &quot;boundary&quot;: &quot;cradle_to_grave&quot;,&#10;    &quot;stages_included&quot;: [&quot;raw_material&quot;, &quot;manufacturing&quot;, &quot;packaging&quot;, &quot;distribution&quot;, &quot;end_of_life&quot;],&#10;    &quot;stages_excluded&quot;: [&quot;use_phase&quot;],&#10;    &quot;exclusion_reason&quot;: &quot;产品为无源家居收纳件，使用阶段无能耗&quot;,&#10;    &quot;gwp_basis&quot;: &quot;AR6_GWP100&quot;,&#10;    &quot;methodology_ref&quot;: &quot;ISO 14067:2018&quot;,&#10;    &quot;verification&quot;: { &quot;level&quot;: &quot;third_party&quot;, &quot;body&quot;: &quot;accredited_vvb&quot;, &quot;valid_until&quot;: &quot;2027-06-30&quot; },&#10;    &quot;hotspot&quot;: { &quot;stage&quot;: &quot;distribution&quot;, &quot;share_pct&quot;: 38.4 },&#10;    &quot;reduction_vs_base&quot;: { &quot;base_year&quot;: 2024, &quot;pct&quot;: -12.5, &quot;base_value&quot;: &quot;2.06&quot; }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"carbon_label\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"display_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.8\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"unit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"kg CO2e\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"declared_unit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1 件（含包装，净重 0.42 kg）\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"boundary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cradle_to_grave\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"stages_included\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"raw_material\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"manufacturing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"packaging\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"distribution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"end_of_life\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"stages_excluded\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"use_phase\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"exclusion_reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"产品为无源家居收纳件，使用阶段无能耗\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"gwp_basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AR6_GWP100\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"methodology_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ISO 14067:2018\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"verification\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"third_party\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"accredited_vvb\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"valid_until\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2027-06-30\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"hotspot\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"stage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"distribution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"share_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">38.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reduction_vs_base\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"base_year\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-12.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"base_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2.06\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>stages_excluded</code> 与 <code>exclusion_reason</code> 是这套结构里最重要的两个字段：它们把&quot;为什么某项没算&quot;从隐含假设变成显式陈述。用户问&quot;为什么不包括使用阶段&quot;，详情页能立刻给出答案，而不是让客服去追研发。审计方追问&quot;你排除了什么&quot;，答案已经躺在数据结构里。</p>\n<p><code>hotspot</code> 字段有一个额外的商业价值：它把碳标签从&quot;合规负担&quot;变成&quot;购物决策辅助&quot;。当消费者看到&quot;这件商品 38% 的碳来自运输&quot;，他对&quot;选择海运慢递&quot;这个选项的接受度会上升——这直接给了卖家把部分订单从空运引导到海运的正当理由，而这是本 hub 第四章减排杠杆里性价比最高的一条。</p>\n<h2 id=\"声明合规的红线\">声明合规的红线</h2><h3 id=\"四条不能碰的说法\">四条不能碰的说法</h3><p>这几年的监管变化集中在&quot;什么话不能说&quot;。欧盟《赋能消费者绿色转型指令》（Directive (EU) 2024/825）修订了《不公平商业行为指令》的相关条款，将基于碳抵消的&quot;碳中和&quot;声明纳入禁止范围，并收紧了对通用环境声明与可持续性标签的要求。其立法脉络是：禁止在没有可验证承诺与独立核验的情况下，仅凭购买碳信用就宣称产品碳中和（<a href=\"https://environment.ec.europa.eu/topics/circular-economy/green-claims_en\">欧盟委员会绿色声明</a>）。</p>\n<p>与之配套的是《绿色声明指令》提案，要求企业用&quot;科学、可核验的方法&quot;支撑显式环境声明，并由独立且获得认可的核验方检查这些声明与标签，其方法学与欧盟环境足迹（PEF）方法对齐（<a href=\"https://environment.ec.europa.eu/topics/circular-economy/green-claims_en\">欧盟绿色声明指令</a>）。</p>\n<p>落到商品详情页上，可操作的红线有四条：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>禁止的说法</th>\n<th>为什么</th>\n<th>替代表述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&quot;碳中和产品&quot;（基于买碳信用）</td>\n<td>抵消不能替代减排，且已在多法域被禁</td>\n<td>&quot;本产品碳足迹 1.8 kg CO₂e，较 2024 年下降 12%&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;环保产品&quot;/&quot;绿色产品&quot;（无据）</td>\n<td>泛化环境声明，缺乏可核验依据</td>\n<td>&quot;包装材料 70% 为再生纸&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;比同类产品更低碳&quot;（无 PCR）</td>\n<td>比较型声明需要同一产品类别规则</td>\n<td>仅在存在适用 PEFCR 时使用，并披露适用范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;零碳&quot;（仅指抵消）</td>\n<td>同第一条</td>\n<td>&quot;运营环节已实现 100% 可再生电力&quot;（并说明范围）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中第一条的现实影响最大：碳信托（Carbon Trust）的碳足迹标签体系已在 2023 年 9 月撤回了&quot;碳中和&quot;声明这一类别，尽管旧标签可能仍在流通（<a href=\"https://www.carbontrust.com/what-we-do/assurance-and-certification/product-carbon-footprint-label\">Carbon Trust 产品碳足迹标签</a>）。该标签体系覆盖 40 多个国家，其对 B2C 产品一律采用摇篮到坟墓边界，B2B 产品可用摇篮到大门，并且对&quot;减量型&quot;声明要求逐年下降且有经过验证的持续减排计划。这套做法可以当作商品碳标签的具体参考标准：<strong>披露型与减量型可行，比较型与抵消型受限</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从核算结果到详情页数字\">从核算结果到详情页数字</h2><h3 id=\"保守取整与运行外键\">保守取整与运行外键</h3><p>最后一环是工程实现：把核算结果变成展示值，同时保证展示值与核算记录可追溯。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 标签快照表：展示值必须可回溯到具体一次核算运行&#10;CREATE TABLE product_carbon_label (&#10;  label_id        TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  sku             TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  site            TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  pcf_run_id      TEXT NOT NULL,          -- 指向核算运行，保证可复算&#10;  declared_unit   TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  boundary        TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (boundary IN&#10;                    (&#39;cradle_to_gate&#39;,&#39;cradle_to_grave&#39;,&#39;cradle_to_customer&#39;)),&#10;  display_value   NUMERIC(10,3) NOT NULL,&#10;  display_unit    TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;kgCO2e&#39;,&#10;  gwp_basis       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  verification    TEXT NOT NULL,           -- self_declared/third_party/certified&#10;  valid_from      DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  valid_to        DATE,&#10;  UNIQUE (sku, site, valid_from)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 展示纪律：按声明精度取整，且取整后不得夸大减排&#10;-- 两位有效数字 + 向下取整，避免&quot;看起来更低&quot;的暗示&#10;CREATE VIEW product_carbon_label_display AS&#10;SELECT sku, site, declared_unit, boundary,&#10;       CASE WHEN display_value &lt; 10&#10;            THEN FLOOR(display_value * 10) / 10.0&#10;            ELSE FLOOR(display_value) END AS shown_value,&#10;       display_unit, verification, valid_from&#10;FROM product_carbon_label&#10;WHERE valid_to IS NULL OR valid_to &gt;= CURRENT_DATE;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 标签快照表：展示值必须可回溯到具体一次核算运行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> product_carbon_label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  label_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  site</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pcf_run_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 指向核算运行，保证可复算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  declared_unit   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  boundary        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (boundary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cradle_to_gate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cradle_to_grave'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cradle_to_customer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  display_value   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  display_unit    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'kgCO2e'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gwp_basis       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  verification    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- self_declared/third_party/certified</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_from      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_to        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (sku, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">site</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, valid_from)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 展示纪律：按声明精度取整，且取整后不得夸大减排</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 两位有效数字 + 向下取整，避免\"看起来更低\"的暗示</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> product_carbon_label_display</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">site</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, declared_unit, boundary,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> display_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> FLOOR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(display_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> FLOOR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(display_value) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shown_value,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       display_unit, verification, valid_from</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product_carbon_label</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> valid_to </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> valid_to </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>用向下取整是一个刻意的保守选择：碳足迹数字的因子不确定性远大于第三位小数，<strong>向上取整会让数字看起来比真实值高，向下取整则略微低估</strong>。这里的原则是：如果一定要有偏差，宁可让数字略高——因为低估会被解读为&quot;美化数据&quot;，在核验与舆论两个层面都更危险。所以更严格的做法是取两位有效数字后<strong>四舍五入到偶数</strong>（银行家舍入），既避免系统性偏向又避免人为夸大精度。</p>\n<p><code>pcf_run_id</code> 外键是整个表结构的关键：任何一个展示数字都必须能追溯到一次完整的核算运行记录，包括当时用的因子版本、活动数据版本、分摊规则版本。没有这条链，标签就只是一个孤立的数字，任何一次审计或消费者质疑都无法回应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>商品碳标签必须绑定三个属性：边界、声明单位、核验状态，缺一不可比、不可信。</li>\n<li>展示分层：主标签给结论、展开层给边界与排除项、详情层给方法与来源。</li>\n<li>四条声明红线：抵消式碳中和、无据泛化环保、无 PCR 的比较型声明、仅指抵消的&quot;零碳&quot;。</li>\n<li>碳信托标签体系的做法可作参考：B2C 用摇篮到坟墓，B2B 可用摇篮到大门，减量型声明需逐年下降且有验证过的持续计划。</li>\n<li>每个展示值必须外键指向一次核算运行，保留因子/活动数据/分摊规则三个版本的追溯链。</li>\n<li>面向监管的另一种披露形态要求完全不同的数据粒度，见 <a href=\"../../carbon-label-disclosure/cbam-carbon-data-report\">CBAM 等碳数据申报要求</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"商品碳标签与买家展示","id":"商品碳标签与买家展示"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"平台展示的信息架构","id":"平台展示的信息架构"},{"level":3,"text":"三段式：结论、边界、来源","id":"三段式-结论-边界-来源"},{"level":2,"text":"声明合规的红线","id":"声明合规的红线"},{"level":3,"text":"四条不能碰的说法","id":"四条不能碰的说法"},{"level":2,"text":"从核算结果到详情页数字","id":"从核算结果到详情页数字"},{"level":3,"text":"保守取整与运行外键","id":"保守取整与运行外键"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"尾程配送碳排与合并派送","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-logistics-carbon-footprint/fulfillment-emission-calc/lastmile-fulfillment-carbon"},"next":{"title":"CBAM 等碳数据申报要求","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-logistics-carbon-footprint/carbon-label-disclosure/cbam-carbon-data-report"}}